# Input

```md
intro
a | b
--- | ---
c | d

> intro
> a | b
> --- | ---
> c | d

- intro
  a | b
  --- | ---
  c | d

```


# Options

```json
{
  "markdown": {
    "parser": {
      "gfm": true
    }
  }
}
```

# Formatted

```md
intro
| a   | b   |
| --- | --- |
| c   | d   |

> intro
> | a   | b   |
> | --- | --- |
> | c   | d   |
- intro
  | a   | b   |
  | --- | --- |
  | c   | d   |

```
